    "body": "When I look at Preview I don't see the variable highlighting.\r\n\r\nhttps://tabatkins.github.io/bikeshed/#algorithms suggests the `algorithm` attribute needs to have a value, but I'm not sure if that's the complete story.\r\n\r\nIt doesn't look like we explicitly disable this in https://github.com/tabatkins/bikeshed-boilerplate/blob/main/boilerplate/whatwg/defaults.include so maybe you have to repeat the algorithm name and it doesn't want to look at the first `<dfn>`?\r\n\r\ncc @jgraham @tabatkins",
